---
description: Python conventions for the Heimdall codebase
globs: backend/**/*.py, ai-brain/**/*.py, vision/**/*.py, tests/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---
- Python 3.11 compatible, type hints on public functions, docstrings with Args/Returns.
- Ruff rules E, F, I, C901 (max complexity 10). complexipy limit 15.
- OSINT and vision talk to the backend only over HTTP. Never import `backend/` code from them.
- Tests: pytest, no live network, no Groq, no ntfy.sh. Use the existing fakes in `ai-brain/tests/test_live_osint.py`.
- Soft deletes only. New env vars go in that module's `.env.example`.
- After edits run: `bash scripts/check`.
